  "description": "Welcome to the Caffeine Fiends, the most cracked guild in the realm! Fueled by the magic dust of the east, we embark on daily quests, conquering dungeons with the speed of a double-shot espresso. Our goblets overflow with brews, and our hearts beat with the rhythm of adventure!\n\n**Join Us!**  \nActive participation is our lifeblood — even a small dose daily keeps the brew strong. Two days without a sip will earn a warning; three days, and you&#039;ll find yourself ejected from the tavern!\n\nReady your mugs, sharpen your swords, and let’s grow this guild, one cup at a time!\n\nhttps://discord.com/invite/M3VHFDmh",
